Abstract = {Aiming at the problem of low accuracy of the current English
   interpretation teaching quality evaluation, a teaching quality
   evaluation method based on a genetic algorithm (GA) optimized RBF neural
   network is proposed. First, the principal component analysis is used to
   select the teaching quality evaluation index, and then design The RBF
   neural network teaching evaluation model is used, and GA is used to
   optimize the initial weights of the RBF neural network. Experimental
   results show that this method can effectively evaluate the quality of
   English interpretation teaching, and has high accuracy and real-time
   performance.},
